{"id":1020503,"chapter_id":1020503,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"不远处，热浪裹挟着粗粝的砂子一阵一阵扑来。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"FAC的反狂厄战士铺成一条战线，他们的武器发出幽幽蓝光，抵抗着那即使在白日中也分外耀眼的火焰。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"FAC战士","content":"加快攻击！！是灰烬使徒！这次灰烬之潮果然是她！！","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"FAC战士","content":"架设最大功率的反狂厄武器！快！","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"被围在中心的曜，浑身上下被火焰覆盖，那双曾经清澈的眼睛也被火舌吞噬，让你无法看清。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"她的手一挥，重重火羽拦住了子弹，在空气里炸出一连串的硝烟。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503005,"trial_step":5},{"step":7,"content":"砂海之中，她几乎和跟随灰烬之潮而来的使徒无二，让人胆颤。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503005,"trial_step":5},{"step":8,"content":"被围在中心的曜，浑身上下被火焰覆盖，那双曾经清澈的眼睛也被火舌吞噬，让你无法看清。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503005,"trial_step":5},{"step":9,"content":"她的手一挥，重重火羽拦住了子弹，在空气里炸出一连串的硝烟。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503005,"trial_step":5},{"step":10,"content":"砂海之中，她几乎和跟随灰烬之潮而来的使徒无二，让人胆颤。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503005,"trial_step":5},{"step":11,"content":"被围在中心的曜，浑身上下被火焰覆盖，那双曾经清澈的眼睛也被火舌吞噬，让你无法看清。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503005,"trial_step":5},{"step":12,"content":"她的手一挥，重重火羽拦住了子弹，在空气里炸出一连串的硝烟。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503005,"trial_step":5},{"step":13,"content":"砂海之中，她几乎和跟随灰烬之潮而来的使徒无二，让人胆颤。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503005,"trial_step":5},{"step":14,"content":"身边的一位FAC战士架设好了武器，扣响了扳机，你先一步，拦住了他的动作。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503006,"trial_step":6},{"step":15,"speaker":"选项","options":["先停止攻击"],"style":6,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503007,"trial_step":7,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"先停止攻击","goto":8}]},{"step":16,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"那不是灰烬使徒的模样，还没到那种地步。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503008,"trial_step":8},{"step":17,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"一味的攻击反而可能带来反效果，先让我去试试吧。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503009,"trial_step":9},{"step":18,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"她是禁闭者，枷锁还有响应，我可以先牵制她，你们看情况再行动。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503010,"trial_step":10},{"step":19,"content":"此时的曜的确和还在管理局时不一样了，火力攻击对她似乎起不到什么作用，眼见局势就要陷入僵局，前线人员也只好同意了你的方案。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503011,"trial_step":11},{"step":20,"content":"这片区域弥漫着异常的狂厄，在茫茫灰烬之潮中，在一众敌意尖锐的环境下，曜已经完全进入另一个状态。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503012,"trial_step":12},{"step":21,"content":"她炽羽流火，金瞳锐利，不属于人类的尖牙和利爪全都显露出来，在污染风暴之中与指着她的众多反狂厄武器凌然对峙着，不落下风，却又显得凄然。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503013,"trial_step":13},{"step":22,"speaker":"选项","options":["安抚她"],"style":6,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503014,"trial_step":14,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"安抚她","goto":15}]},{"step":23,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"是我，曜。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503015,"trial_step":15},{"step":24,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"让我来帮帮你，好吗？我已经让他们停下来了。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503016,"trial_step":16},{"step":25,"content":"你缓缓地向她靠近，顶着灼热烈风向她伸手。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503017,"trial_step":17},{"step":26,"speaker":"选项","options":["别怕，来，把手给我？"],"style":6,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503018,"trial_step":18,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"别怕，来，把手给我？","goto":22}]},{"step":27,"content":"你想再向前，但已经做不到了。热砂飞石撞击面罩，防护服已经出现溶解，你的肌肉本能地拉扯你退缩，连意识也有些模糊。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503019,"trial_step":19},{"step":28,"content":"而曜就这么看着你，没有攻击，也没有靠近。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503020,"trial_step":20},{"step":29,"content":"她看起来不再那么恐慌，她屹立在热浪中心，充满力量，像火焰中女妖神，又像突然离你很远的陌生人。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503021,"trial_step":21},{"step":30,"speaker":"曜","content":"……","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503022,"trial_step":22},{"step":31,"speaker":"曜","content":"我不希望你来，但也知道你一定会来……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503023,"trial_step":23},{"step":32,"speaker":"曜","content":"所以，我也有话要告诉你……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503024,"trial_step":24},{"step":33,"speaker":"曜","content":"……不用再找我了，别再靠近危险……我，很危险……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503025,"trial_step":25},{"step":34,"content":"你愣住了。你从未听过她用这种语气对你说话，明明不久前，她还是那个黏在你身边的小家伙。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503026,"trial_step":26},{"step":35,"content":"她又长大了，一夜间变成你不认识的模样。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503027,"trial_step":27},{"step":36,"options":["……是大家吓到你了吗？"],"style":6,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503028,"trial_step":28,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……是大家吓到你了吗？","goto":29}]},{"step":37,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"那是误会，他们害怕的不是你，是别的东西。他们怕你变成别的东西。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503029,"trial_step":29},{"step":38,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"但我知道你不会，我知道曜是什么样的人，我知道你想变成什么样的人。就算有麻烦，我也会跟你一起努力的。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503030,"trial_step":30},{"step":39,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"回来吧，曜。只要你不想变成我的敌人，我们就永远不是敌人。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503031,"trial_step":31},{"step":40,"content":"曜缓缓地低下了头，默默地看着脚下。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503032,"trial_step":32},{"step":41,"speaker":"曜","content":"不……不怪他们……不怪你们任何人……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503033,"trial_step":33},{"step":42,"speaker":"伊帕希娅","content":"是我无法成为你们期望的模样……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503034,"trial_step":34},{"step":43,"speaker":"曜","content":"我常常做梦，梦到这里，梦到更远处……梦见大家期盼的那个巫祭。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503035,"trial_step":35},{"step":44,"speaker":"曜","content":"她手持利剑与怪物为敌，挡在风暴前，挡在天灾前保护众人。她永远笑着，走在人群中，被所有人信任着，爱着，她永远属于人间。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503036,"trial_step":36},{"step":45,"speaker":"曜","content":"我知道，那是大家希望见到的“曜”，你们留下我、透过我的眼睛，寻找一个美好的人类。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503037,"trial_step":37},{"step":46,"content":"她的声音缓慢，但流畅地向你表达着自己。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503038,"trial_step":38},{"step":47,"content":"只是那声音如今染上了狂厄的回响，不断在你脑海激荡。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503039,"trial_step":39},{"step":48,"speaker":"曜","content":"可我已经不再是人类了。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503040,"trial_step":40},{"step":49,"speaker":"曜","content":"就算梦到了、想起来，那个人的事也离我好远，一切都会变得混沌而不纯粹。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503041,"trial_step":41},{"step":50,"speaker":"曜","content":"即使在你身边，我也无法感到安心，我只看到自己怪物般的身体，看清我处处跟别人不同，我回不到过去，我回应不了你们的期待。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503042,"trial_step":42},{"step":51,"speaker":"曜","content":"而在梦里，我看见更辽阔的世界，更宽广的时间，更庞大的生命……不用再禁锢力量，不用再压抑自己……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503043,"trial_step":43},{"step":52,"speaker":"曜","content":"我无法成为笼中鸟，我也该有自己的使命，我也想<color=#fb9259>尽情燃烧</color>……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503044,"trial_step":44},{"step":53,"speaker":"曜","content":"我知道……我在渴望回到天灾……渴望直面使徒……渴望真正的自己……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503045,"trial_step":45},{"step":54,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"！！","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503046,"trial_step":46},{"step":55,"content":"曜不再多言，火焰形成的翅膀缓慢在她的背后展开，不必做任何大动作，那缓慢攀升的高温就足够逼退你们。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503047,"trial_step":47},{"step":56,"content":"——你明白曜的用意，她在驱赶你们所有人。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503048,"trial_step":48},{"step":57,"speaker":"曜","content":"走吧，我不想伤害你们，也无法回到人群之中。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503049,"trial_step":49},{"step":58,"speaker":"曜","content":"流动的时间永不停驻，命运前行也不会再回头。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503050,"trial_step":50},{"step":59,"speaker":"曜","content":"名叫阿煦的巫祭已经死去，现在的我永生摆脱不了狂厄和天灾，我注定与它们同行。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503051,"trial_step":51},{"step":60,"speaker":"曜","content":"……放弃我吧……对不起……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503052,"trial_step":52},{"step":61,"content":"她说得平静而决绝，拥有令人信服的力量。可她也是你的禁闭者，枷锁的另一头传来微妙的情感，戳破了这近乎完美的谎言。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503053,"trial_step":53},{"step":62,"content":"你明白她的痛苦，你感受着她的悲伤。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503054,"trial_step":54},{"step":63,"content":"你不顾周围人的劝阻，踏着滚烫的白砂前进。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503055,"trial_step":55},{"step":64,"speaker":"选项","options":["我才应该说对不起"],"style":6,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503056,"trial_step":56,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我才应该说对不起","goto":57}]},{"step":65,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"对不起，将你困在管理局，真的不是我的本意，我不知道你待在管理局里会那么痛苦。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503057,"trial_step":57},{"step":66,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"是我自以为是了，我以我自己的视角去理所当然地认为，你适合那个地方。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503058,"trial_step":58},{"step":67,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"但我从不需要你变成“巫祭”，从我接回你的那一刻开始就无需如此。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503059,"trial_step":59},{"step":68,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"而且，我还记得，烟烟在找回你的时候给我的通讯。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503060,"trial_step":60},{"step":69,"speaker":"烟烟","content":"局长局长！好消息！天大的好消息呀！！","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503061,"trial_step":61},{"step":70,"speaker":"烟烟","content":"我们找到曜姐姐啦！真的是她！！","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503062,"trial_step":62},{"step":71,"speaker":"烟烟","content":"你别不信我呀！我觉得她和曜姐姐一模一样，连祂也确认了，能量体系和曜姐姐就是同一个人！","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503063,"trial_step":63},{"step":72,"speaker":"曜","content":"……","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503064,"trial_step":64},{"step":73,"speaker":"选项","options":["他们说的是“曜”"],"style":6,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503065,"trial_step":65,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"他们说的是“曜”","goto":66}]},{"step":74,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我们在寻找的不是“巫祭”，而是……<color=#fb9259>曜</color>。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503066,"trial_step":66},{"step":75,"content":"那双翅膀的动作渐渐停了下来，几缕纯白的烟雾缓缓散开。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503067,"trial_step":67},{"step":76,"content":"你伸出手，再次慢慢地，慢慢地朝曜走去。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503068,"trial_step":68},{"step":77,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我很高兴你能诞生在这个世界上，很高兴你能来我身边。无论你是以什么样的形态，选择去哪里，我都希望你能得到幸福。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503069,"trial_step":69},{"step":78,"options":["——我希望你能幸福。"],"style":6,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503070,"trial_step":70,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"——我希望你能幸福。","goto":71}]},{"step":79,"speaker":"曜","content":"我——我不是人类，我不能留在你的身边。","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503071,"trial_step":71},{"step":80,"options":["那你也永远不是我们的敌人"],"style":6,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503072,"trial_step":72,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"那你也永远不是我们的敌人","goto":73}]},{"step":81,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"瞧，你现在已经能精确控制火焰，一点火星都不冒出来，也再不伤害任何人。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503073,"trial_step":73},{"step":82,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"所以别吓唬我了，再聊聊好吗？告诉我你真正的想法，你想要去哪里。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503074,"trial_step":74},{"step":83,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"就算你无论如何都要走……就这么不明不白地走了。","style":2,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503075,"trial_step":75},{"step":84,"content":"曜直愣愣地看着你，好看的眼睛又一次露出了独属于曜的那种澄澈。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503076,"trial_step":76},{"step":85,"speaker":"曜","content":"……","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503077,"trial_step":77},{"step":86,"speaker":"曜","content":"……舍不得的人是我……","voice":["vo_trial_20503_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_yao_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120503078,"trial_step":78},{"step":87,"content":"一直注视着你的曜，突然猛地停在了原地，正要回应你的手也不